# Test Registration API

### Register Temp User (Perorangan)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/registration
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userType": "perorangan",
  "nik": "1234567890123456",
  "namaPemohon": "John Doe Test",
  "email": "john.test@example.com",
  "telepon": "081234567890",
  "npwp": "123456789012345",
  "alamatPemohon": "Jl. Test No. 123, Jakarta",
  "password": "testpassword123"
}

### Register Temp User (Perusahaan)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/registration
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userType": "perusahaan",
  "nik": "9876543210987654",
  "namaPemohon": "Jane Smith Test",
  "email": "jane.test@example.com",
  "telepon": "081987654321",
  "npwp": "987654321098765",
  "alamatPemohon": "Jl. Corporate No. 456, Jakarta",
  "password": "testpassword456",
  "perusahaan": {
    "namaPerusahaan": "PT Test Sukses",
    "alamatPerusahaan": "Jl. Business District No. 789, Jakarta"
  }
}

### Get All Temp Users (Admin/Verifikatur only)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/registration/temp-users
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Statistics (Admin/Verifikatur only) 
GET http://localhost:3000/api/registration/statistics
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Verify Temp User - Approve (Admin/Verifikatur only)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/registration/temp-users/TEMP_USER_ID/verify
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "approve",
  "notes": "Data lengkap dan valid"
}

### Verify Temp User - Reject (Admin/Verifikatur only)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/registration/temp-users/TEMP_USER_ID/verify
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "reject",
  "notes": "Data tidak sesuai persyaratan"
}
